{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Problems and Solutions"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Book Launch"}, {"type": "position", "content": 10}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 12}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.3"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe the reasons or results of events or actions in spoken or written texts, in work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken"}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn11le12ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Will and Would to Express Willingness or Intention"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you want to express intention to do something or a willingness to do something, you can use the verbs<span class=italic> will</span> and <span class=italic>would</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Context is particularly important to understand the exact meaning of each verb."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": " <span class=italic>George <span class=strong>will</span> translate for you - he speaks French. </span>(willingness)<br> <span class=italic>I'<span class=strong>ll</span> sit on the floor - I don't mind. </span>(willingness)<br> <span class=italic>I <span class=strong>won't</span> be coming later. </span>(intention)<br> <span class=italic><span class=strong>Would </span>you mind helping me, please?</span> (willingness)<br> <span class=italic>I'<span class=strong>ll</span> call you later.</span> (intention)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read the examples from the text. Keep the context in mind as you do."}, {"type": "example", "content": " I would like to give you a brief overview of our plans for the book launch."}, {"type": "example", "content": "As you may have heard, we will be going ahead with the book signing."}, {"type": "example", "content": "In the end, we decided that a few bottles of wine would be nice."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'll expect you all the be there pitching in at that point."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Modals for Expressing Duty and Advice"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You can use a variety of modals to talk about what is necessary, what someone is responsible for and to give advice. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "The modals <span class=italic>should</span> and <span class=italic>ought to </span>are interchangeable when you talk about duty or give advice."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=italic>You<span class=strong> should /ought to </span>take a hat today - it's cold. </span>(advice)<br> <span class=italic>People <span class=strong>should/ought to </span>be more considerate around the holiday season. </span>(duty)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "However, when you talk about yourself and give advice to yourself you do not use <span class=strong>ought to</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=italic>I <span class=strong> should take a coat. </span>(not, I ought to take a coat)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use should / ought to + have + past participle to talk about duty in the past. You often indicate a criticism or regret."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=italic>He <span class=strong>should have asked </span>me before. <br> We <span class=strong>ought to have taken</span> a cab.  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "You should have received a proposed itinerary by e-mail as well, so I'll just go over some of the highlights."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Adam pointed out that we should probably wait until the afternoon when the kids would be out of school."}, {"type": "example", "content": "There was also a lot of debate as to whether we ought to serve alcohol."}, {"type": "example", "content": "It ought to give the event a more celebratory feel."}, {"type": "example", "content": "We've contacted several people in the industry, and we should have our guest lecturer confirmed by the end of the week. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "celebratory "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "celebrating an important event or occasion"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: In the end, we decided that a few bottles of wine would be nice. It ought to give the event a more celebratory feel."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le12ob10aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to plan an event."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "feel "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the way that something feels; the ambiance or atmosphere"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I don't want it to have a sombre feel."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le12ob10aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "spread "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an assortment of foods; a meal "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Adam contacted the company last week, so they ought to have a nice spread prepared for the big launch."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le12ob10aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to publicize "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to provide information about a product or service to the public"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We've been publicizing the event on social media all month."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le12ob10aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "guest of honor "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the most important person at an event"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There ought to be a big lineup once the guest of honor arrives."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le12ob10aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to pitch in "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to help"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'll expect you all the be there pitching in at that point, as we can always use an extra hand for crowd control."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le12ob10aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "guru "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an expert and teacher"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I understand that the guest of honor is a technology guru."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le12ob10aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "guest lecturer "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an expert in a particular field who speaks at an event"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We will be inviting a social media guru to speak at the event and introduce Marisa."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le12ob10aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to knuckle down "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to work hard"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Let's really try to knuckle down and make this our best launch ever!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le12ob10aud09"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose a famous author and learn about him or her online."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Take notes regarding your author's literary career."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Pretend that your author will be speaking at an event, and plan a short introduction."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Deliver your introduction to your classmates."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research a famous author."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read and take notes."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I plan an introduction."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I introduce someone to my classmates."}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"questions": [], "img_path": "intro_7124.jpg", "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can express willingness or intention to do something in work and job issues."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can express duty and advice  related to work and job issues."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can request or report about the purpose of events or actions related to job issues."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Have you ever attended a book launch? How was it?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " If you could meet any living author, who would you choose? Why?"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct"}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": " Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": " Let's plan the big launch!"}], "id": 0}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}]}], "stimuli_ids": [1], "template_override": 1, "type": "STI", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "te