eedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "id": 11}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn11le12ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "Thanks for coming, everyone. I would like to give you a brief overview of our plans for the book launch. You should have received a proposed itinerary by e-mail as well, so I'll just go over some of the highlights. As you may have heard, we will be going ahead with the book signing. Originally we had planned to do it at lunchtime, but Adam pointed out that we should probably wait until the afternoon when the kids would be out of school.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le12ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "24000", "text": "There was also a lot of debate as to whether we ought to serve alcohol. In the end, we decided that a few bottles of wine would be nice. It ought to give the event a more celebratory feel. The signing will also be catered. Adam contacted the company last week, so they ought to have a nice spread prepared for the big launch.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le12ob10re2img06.jpg"}, {"time": "43000", "text": "On the day of the signing, Adam and I will arrive early. This should give us plenty of time to set up. We've been publicizing the event on social media all month, so there ought to be a big lineup once the guest of honor arrives. I'll expect you all will be there pitching in at that point, as we can always use an extra hand for crowd control.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le12ob10re2img07.jpg"}, {"time": "63000", "text": "One more thing: we will be inviting a social media guru to speak at the event and introduce Marisa. We've contacted several people in the industry, and we should have our guest lecturer confirmed by the end of next week. <br/>Thanks for your attention. Let's really try to knuckle down and make this our best launch ever.", "id": 4, "image": "engenn11le12ob10re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le12ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le12ob10re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": [], "title": ""}], "id": 0}]}